  "releaseNotes": "'# [9.3.0](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v9.2.0...v9.3.0) (2025-03-26)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Add support for System.Object in CRDs ([#857](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/857)) ([44cfb7e](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/44cfb7ecea54b5c481c354d74eef4290734bdd38))\n* x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields incorrectly applied on List<T> ([#850](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/850)) ([201e14e](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/201e14e9e2d77363e9baaeda18c8dc9fc4628d5b))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* Add auto-generated comment to generated code files ([#848](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/848)) ([09aaef9](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/09aaef96562c72747ed70c7c5e7f0cf0b60e48e2))\n* changing the kustomization commonLabels ([#856](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/856)) ([3de2c1a](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/3de2c1aa32ab7de744c8c702c0a5eb86d7a6e70a))\n* Introduction of `ValidationRuleAttribute` as support for `x-kubernetes-validations` in Kubernetes CRDs ([#859](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/859)) ([59e19d6](https://github.com/buehler/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/59e19d6f2cde0bf42c7d4b00dec3dbff27410915))\n\n\n\n'",
